### Mock credit bureau - called by the REST Connector "Request credit assessment"
POST http://localhost:8081/mock/credit-bureau/assessments
Content-Type: application/json

< ./credit-assessment-request.json

### Error case: HTTP 500 (routes the instance to manual review via BPMN error CREDIT_API_ERROR)
POST http://localhost:8081/mock/credit-bureau/assessments
Content-Type: application/json

{"applicationId": "LA-2026-0006", "applicantId": "APP-ERR-500"}

### Timeout case: answers after 8 s, the connector read timeout is 5 s (HTTP 408 in the error expression)
POST http://localhost:8081/mock/credit-bureau/assessments
Content-Type: application/json

{"applicationId": "LA-2026-0007", "applicantId": "APP-TIMEOUT"}

### Fault injection: break / repair dependencies for the incident demo
GET http://localhost:8081/admin/faults

###
POST http://localhost:8081/admin/faults/validation-reference-data?enabled=true

###
POST http://localhost:8081/admin/faults/validation-reference-data?enabled=false

### Start a process instance through the Orchestration Cluster API (Camunda 8 Run, unprotected local API)
POST http://localhost:8080/v2/process-instances
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "processDefinitionId": "loan-approval",
  "variables": {
    "applicationId": "LA-2026-0100", "applicantId": "APP-1001", "fullName": "Synthetic Applicant Alpha",
    "email": "synthetic.applicant.alpha@example.org", "age": 35, "employmentStatus": "EMPLOYED",
    "monthlyIncome": 6200, "monthlyDebtPayments": 400, "loanAmount": 25000, "loanTermMonths": 60,
    "loanPurpose": "Home renovation"
  }
}
